   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = help: for that trait implementation, expected `ForReply<_>`, found `ForSlot`
   = note: required for `(ruststream::runtime::WithSource<ruststream::runtime::OutAttachment<Audit, MemoryPublish>>,)` to implement `ruststream::runtime::AdmitsSlotAt<StampSource, ruststream::runtime::SlotPos<0>, MemoryBroker>`
   = note: required for `(ruststream::runtime::NoReply, (ruststream::runtime::WithSource<ruststream::runtime::OutAttachment<Audit, MemoryPublish>>,))` to implement `ruststream::runtime::AdmitsAt<StampSource, ruststream::runtime::SlotPos<0>, runtime::router::mount::InjectMount, SubscriberBuilder<mirror, Name, (Open, Open, Open, Open)>, MemoryBroker>`
